## C. METRICS
| Metric | Formula |
|--------|---------|
| Accuracy | `(TP+TN)/N` |
| Precision | `TP/(TP+FP)` |
| Recall | `TP/(TP+FN)` |
| F1 | `2PR/(P+R)` |
| AUC-ROC | Area under TPR vs FPR curve |
| IoU | `inter/(area1+area2-inter)` |
| NDCG | `DCG/IDCG`; `DCG=Σ r/log2(i+2)` |
| MAP@K | `mean(precision at each hit)` |

```python
def prf(yt,yp):
    TP=sum(a==b==1 for a,b in zip(yt,yp));FP=sum(a==0 and b==1 for a,b in zip(yt,yp))
    FN=sum(a==1 and b==0 for a,b in zip(yt,yp));TN=sum(a==b==0 for a,b in zip(yt,yp))
    p=TP/(TP+FP+1e-9);r=TP/(TP+FN+1e-9);return p,r,2*p*r/(p+r+1e-9),(TP+TN)/len(yt)
def iou(b1,b2):
    xi1,yi1=max(b1[0],b2[0]),max(b1[1],b2[1])
    xi2,yi2=min(b1[2],b2[2]),min(b1[3],b2[3])
    inter=max(0,xi2-xi1)*max(0,yi2-yi1)
    return inter/((b1[2]-b1[0])*(b1[3]-b1[1])+(b2[2]-b2[0])*(b2[3]-b2[1])-inter+1e-9)
def ndcg(rel,k=None):
    r=rel[:k] if k else rel
    dcg=sum(v/math.log2(i+2) for i,v in enumerate(r))
    idcg=sum(v/math.log2(i+2) for i,v in enumerate(sorted(r,reverse=True)))
    return dcg/(idcg+1e-9)
def auc(yt,ys):
    pairs=sorted(zip(ys,yt),reverse=True);tp=fp=auc=0
    tp_tot=sum(yt);fp_tot=len(yt)-tp_tot
    for _,l in pairs:
        if l==1: tp+=1
        else: auc+=tp;fp+=1
    return auc/(tp_tot*fp_tot+1e-9)
```

